OL,5,G1100 Reuben Owen: Life in The Dales
OL,6,     FIt's springtime in the Dales, and
OL,7,     Fat Brough Castle Farm, Reuben and
OL,8,     FJess race to stock-proof the
OL,9,     Ffences before more than 300
OL,10,     Fnewborn lambs arrive in the
OL,11,     Ffields.
OL,12,G1200 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen visits Bette in the wilds of
OL,14,     Fnorthern Queensland, where she's
OL,15,     Fbeen dealing with snakes, floods
OL,16,     Fand isolation since moving to the
OL,17,     Fharsh Australian wilderness 30
OL,18,     Fyears ago.
