OL,5,G1800 Inside the Tower of London
OL,6,     FIt's spring 2022, and deputy
OL,7,     Fgovernor Debbie Whittingham and
OL,8,     Fyeoman gaoler Rob Fuller have
OL,9,     Fspotted an impressive visitor
OL,10,     Fberthed across the river from the
OL,11,     FTower.
